"Hi, I'm Kiran. I'm a DevOps engineer, and I live in Dublin.
I started my career at Debots in Hyderabad, doing cloud support work on AWS. Then I joined Cognizant, where I worked for about three and a half years on the RELX Group account. My project was Lexis+, the legal research platform from LexisNexis. Lawyers use it to search case law, check citations with Shepard's, and analyse their legal briefs.
