Three tips for speaking

	•	Answer, then stop. Keep it to 30–40 seconds, and let them ask the next question.
	•	If you don't know, say so: "I haven't done that directly, but this is how I would approach it…"
	•	Use "I" for your own work and "we" for team work. Interviewers listen for what you did personally.

